/* 简体中文 */

"Metal HUD test" = "金属 HUD 测试";
"Done" = "完成";
"Reboot the device?" = "重启设备？";
"Reboot" = "重启";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"Writes Apple's Metal HUD switch into the target app's defaults (or the global domain)." = "把 Apple 的 Metal HUD 开关写进目标 App 的 defaults（或全局域）。";
"Last run" = "上次运行";
"Clear" = "清空";
"Per-app HUD (recommended)" = "按 App 开启（推荐）";
"On iOS the HUD switch is read from the launching app's own defaults, so pick the game and write the key into its container. A global preference is not enough for most App Store apps." = "iOS 上 HUD 开关是从「启动它的那个 App 自己的 defaults」里读的。选一个游戏，把键写进它的容器。对大多数 App Store App 来说，只写全局域是不够的。";
"Load installed apps" = "加载已安装 App";
"Search apps or bundle id" = "搜索 App 或 bundle id";
"Enable for app" = "为这个 App 开启";
"Check" = "检测";
"Off" = "关闭";
"See the HUD in this app" = "在本 App 里看到 HUD";
"Renders a Metal triangle here and enables the HUD for this process with MTL_HUD_ENABLED. If an FPS overlay appears in the corner, the HUD works on this device — then use the per-app action for a game." = "这里会渲染一个 Metal 三角形，并用 MTL_HUD_ENABLED 为本进程打开 HUD。如果右上角出现 FPS 叠加层，说明这台设备上 HUD 能工作——然后再用「按 App 开启」去开游戏。";
"Open HUD test" = "打开 HUD 测试";
"Global preference (experimental)" = "全局域（实验性）";
"Writes MetalForceHudEnabled into .GlobalPreferences.plist. This is the classic tweak route; on iOS it is not reliably read by App Store apps, so treat it as a fallback." = "把 MetalForceHudEnabled 写进 .GlobalPreferences.plist。这是传统 tweak 路线；iOS 上 App Store App 不一定读取它，所以只当备选。";
"Enable in global domain" = "写入全局域";
"Disable" = "关闭";
"Restore global prefs backup" = "恢复全局偏好备份";
"Diagnostics" = "诊断";
"Device" = "设备";
"Last write" = "上次写入";
"Rebooted since write" = "写后是否重启";
"cfprefsd (global)" = "cfprefsd（全局）";
"Last target" = "上次目标";
"cfprefsd only re-reads preference files at boot. A write without a reboot can be invisible to the target app even though the file on disk is correct." = "cfprefsd 只在开机时重新读取偏好文件。即使磁盘上的文件已经正确，不重启的话目标 App 也可能看不到。";
"How to see the HUD in a game" = "如何在游戏里看到 HUD";
"Not every app shows the HUD: some games do not render with Metal directly. Try a 3D game known to use Metal (e.g. Wuthering Waves, Call of Duty: Mobile, Bright Memory)." = "并不是所有 App 都会显示 HUD：有些游戏不是直接用 Metal 渲染。可以试已知支持 Metal 的 3D 游戏（例如《鸣潮》《使命召唤手游》《光明记忆》）。";
"Apply" = "生效";
"Preferences are on disk, but cfprefsd caches them. Restart the device so every process reads the new values." = "偏好已经写在磁盘上，但 cfprefsd 会缓存它们。重启设备才能让所有进程读到新值。";
"Reboot device" = "重启设备";
"Pairing file ready" = "配对文件已就绪";
"Pairing required" = "需要配对";
"A pairing file was found, so every action is available." = "已找到配对文件，所有操作可用。";
"The exploit needs a pairing file. Pair this iPhone with itself below, or share an existing pairing file into this app." = "逃逸需要配对文件。可以在下面让这台 iPhone 与自身配对，或把现有配对文件分享进这个 App。";
"Type it in Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode › Pair with App" = "在 设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式 › 与 App 配对 里输入它";
"Start pairing" = "开始配对";
"Re-check" = "重新检查";
"Open LocalDevVPN" = "打开 LocalDevVPN";
"Import pairing file" = "导入配对文件";
"Export pairing file" = "导出配对文件";
"Loopback tunnel address" = "回环隧道地址";
"LocalDevVPN has to be running in loopback mode. 10.7.0.1 by default; try 10.7.0.2 or 10.7.0.3 if it will not connect." = "LocalDevVPN 需要运行在回环模式。默认 10.7.0.1；连不上可以试 10.7.0.2 或 10.7.0.3。";
"⚠️ Never enter 127.0.0.1: remotepairingdeviced refuses the control channel and drops into a state where every connection fails, until you toggle Developer Mode off and on again." = "⚠️ 千万不要填 127.0.0.1：那会让 remotepairingdeviced 拒绝控制通道并进入丢弃状态，之后所有连接都会失败，只能靠关掉再打开开发者模式恢复。";
"Run log" = "运行日志";
"Hide" = "收起";
"Show" = "展开";
"Enable Metal HUD" = "开启 Metal HUD";
"Disable Metal HUD" = "关闭 Metal HUD";
"Restore prefs backup" = "恢复偏好备份";
"Not checked" = "未检测";
"Metal HUD enabled" = "Metal HUD 已开启";
"Metal HUD disabled" = "Metal HUD 已关闭";
"HUD key not set" = "HUD 键未设置";
"cfprefsd caches preferences and is not restarted by a respring. A reboot is the only guaranteed way to make it re-read the files." = "cfprefsd 会缓存偏好，而且注销（respring）不会重启它。只有重启设备才能保证它重新读取文件。";
"Log" = "日志";
"Settings" = "设置";
"visible" = "能感知";
"cached" = "有缓存";
"Test cfprefsd reload" = "测试 cfprefsd 重载";
"cfprefsd external edit" = "cfprefsd 外部修改";
"Respring (SpringBoard restart) does not restart cfprefsd; only a reboot is guaranteed to clear its cache. If the probe says cfprefsd notices external edits, a force-quit and relaunch may be enough for a target app." = "注销（重启 SpringBoard）不会重启 cfprefsd；只有重启设备才能保证清掉缓存。如果探测结果显示 cfprefsd 能感知外部修改，那么把目标 App 强制退出再打开就可能足够。";
"No log yet." = "暂无日志。";
"About" = "关于";
"Version" = "版本";
"GitHub repository" = "GitHub 仓库";
"1. Reboot first — this clears cfprefsd's cache." = "1. 先重启设备——这会清掉 cfprefsd 的缓存。";
"2. In this app, load installed apps and pick the game. Do not open the game yet." = "2. 在本 App 里加载已安装 App，选中游戏。此时先不要打开游戏。";
"3. Tap Enable for app and wait for write verified." = "3. 点「为这个 App 开启」，等待 write verified。";
"4. Now open the game — the HUD should appear." = "4. 现在再打开游戏——HUD 应该出现。";
"If Check still shows false after this, the app may not honour HUD defaults on iOS; that case needs the desktop DVT/MTL_HUD_ENABLED route." = "如果按这个顺序做完 Check 仍然是 false，说明这个 App 在 iOS 上不认这套 defaults，只能走电脑端的 DVT / MTL_HUD_ENABLED 注入。";
"Recommended order: reboot → write → launch the game." = "推荐顺序：重启 → 写入 → 再打开游戏。";
"Launch with HUD (no reboot)" = "启动并显示 HUD（免重启）";
"Launches the app with MTL_HUD_ENABLED=1 through CoreDevice — no reboot and no defaults change. Try this first on iOS; the defaults route below is the fallback." = "通过 CoreDevice 用 MTL_HUD_ENABLED=1 启动游戏——不用重启，也不改 defaults。iOS 上先试这个；下面的 defaults 路线是备选。";
"HUD options" = "HUD 选项";
"HUD scale" = "HUD 缩放";
"Alignment" = "位置";
"Layout" = "显示内容";
"The HUD is drawn at the game's own render resolution, so it scales with the frame and can look soft. A larger scale (0.3–0.5) is easier to read; the game's own resolution setting has the final say." = "HUD 是按游戏自己的渲染分辨率绘制的，会跟着画面一起被缩放，所以可能发虚。调大缩放（0.3–0.5）会更好读；最终清晰度还是取决于游戏自己的分辨率设置。";
"Leave the scale empty to use Apple's default (0.2). Alignment codes: tr/tl/tc/cl/c/cr/bl/bc/br. Changes take effect on the next “Launch with HUD”." = "缩放留空即用 Apple 默认值（0.2）。位置代码：tr/tl/tc/cl/c/cr/bl/bc/br。改完下次「启动并显示 HUD」生效。";
"System default" = "系统默认";
"If the HUD collapses into a single horizontal line, the game probably rotated or changed its drawable while launching. Leave these on System default (Apple: 0.2 / topright / Lite) and launch again." = "如果 HUD 缩成一条横线，通常是游戏在启动时旋转/改变了绘制尺寸。把这些选项留在「系统默认」（Apple 默认 0.2 / 右上 / Lite）再启动一次。";
